#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:3
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Rečnik pojmova"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:6
msgid "RSS"
msgstr "RSS"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:8
msgid ""
"**RSS** *(Really Simple Syndication)* is a web feed format that is used to "
"publish frequently updated content, like news articles, blog posts, etc. It "
"is a format that is particularly suited to being read by computers, and is "
"therefore the preferred way of getting content from the web into an e-book. "
"There are many other feed formats in use on the Internet, and calibre "
"understands most of them. In particular, it has good support for the *ATOM* "
"format, which is commonly used for blogs."
msgstr "**RSS** *(Really Simple Syndication)* je format veb-dovoda za objavljivanje sadržaja koji se često ažurira, kao što su vesti i objave na blogovima. Posebno je pogodan za računarsku obradu, pa je najpraktičniji način da se sadržaj sa veba prenese u e-knjigu. Na internetu se koriste i mnogi drugi formati dovoda, a calibre razume većinu njih. Naročito dobro podržava format *ATOM*, koji se često koristi za blogove."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:9
msgid "recipe"
msgstr "recept"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:11
msgid ""
"A recipe is a set of instructions that teach calibre how to convert an "
"online news source, such as a magazine or a blog, into an e-book. A recipe "
"is essentially `Python <https://www.python.org>`_ code. As such, it is "
"capable of converting arbitrarily complex news sources into e-books. At the "
"simplest level, it is just a set of variables, such as URLs, that give "
"calibre enough information to go out onto the Internet and download the "
"news."
msgstr "Recept je skup uputstava pomoću kojih calibre pretvara internet izvor vesti, poput časopisa ili bloga, u e-knjigu. Recept je, u suštini, kod napisan u jeziku `Python <https://www.python.org>`_. Zato može da pretvori i veoma složene izvore vesti u e-knjige. U najjednostavnijem obliku, sastoji se od promenljivih, kao što su URL adrese, koje programu calibre daju dovoljno podataka da na internetu pronađe i preuzme vesti."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:12
msgid "HTML"
msgstr "HTML"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:14
msgid ""
"**HTML** *(Hyper Text Mark-Up Language)*, a subset of Standard Generalized "
"Mark-Up Language (SGML) for electronic publishing, is the specific standard "
"used for the World Wide Web."
msgstr "**HTML** *(Hyper Text Mark-Up Language)* je podskup standardnog opšteg jezika za označavanje (SGML) namenjen elektronskom izdavaštvu i standard koji se koristi na vebu."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:15
msgid "CSS"
msgstr "CSS"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:17
msgid ""
"**CSS** *(Cascading Style Sheets)* is a language used to describe how an "
":term:`HTML` document should be rendered (visual styling)."
msgstr "**CSS** *(Cascading Style Sheets)* je jezik koji opisuje kako dokument napisan u jeziku :term:`HTML` treba da se prikaže, odnosno njegov vizuelni izgled."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:18
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:20
msgid ""
"**API** *(Application Programming Interface)* is a source code interface "
"that a library provides to support requests for services to be made of it by"
" computer programs."
msgstr "**API** *(Application Programming Interface)* je programski interfejs koji biblioteka pruža drugim programima kako bi mogli da koriste njene usluge."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:21
msgid "LRF"
msgstr "LRF"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:23
msgid "**LRF** The e-book format that is read by the SONY e-book readers."
msgstr "**LRF** je format e-knjiga koji mogu da čitaju SONY čitači e-knjiga."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:24
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:26
msgid ""
"**URL** *(Uniform Resource Locator)* for example: ``http://example.com``"
msgstr "**URL** *(Uniform Resource Locator)* je adresa resursa na internetu, na primer: ``http://example.com``."

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:27
msgid "regexp"
msgstr "regularni izraz"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/glossary.rst:29
msgid ""
"**Regular expressions** provide a concise and flexible means for identifying"
" strings of text of interest, such as particular characters, words, or "
"patterns of characters. See :doc:`the tutorial <regexp>` for an introduction"
" to regular expressions."
msgstr "**Regularni izrazi** omogućavaju sažeto i fleksibilno pronalaženje delova teksta, kao što su određeni znakovi, reči ili obrasci znakova. Uvod u regularne izraze potražite u :doc:`uputstvu <regexp>`."
